afx:Ev_D08 a arch:EvidenceRecord ;
    arch:evidenceSummary "477 pyproject.toml references, a providers/ package tree, a Go module (github.com/apache/airflow/go-sdk), and 23 tsconfig files across one repository confirm a polyglot monorepo with package-by-feature layout. Directly mechanically verified." .

